{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/rmhk3q5o","slide":9,"text":"餐饮行业，本质上是和人打交道。","textPreview":"餐饮行业，本质上是和人打交道。","textChars":15,"textLines":1,"bbox":[90,174,900,40]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/y1kre1w7","slide":9,"text":"员工有情绪","textPreview":"员工有情绪","textChars":5,"textLines":1,"bbox":[100,265,160,38]}
