{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/65wjudg7","slide":11,"text":"五项修炼解决“成为谁”，BMGS 解决“怎么干”","textPreview":"五项修炼解决“成为谁”，BMGS 解决“怎么干”","textChars":24,"textLines":1,"bbox":[54,75,850,70]}
