{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/fa9w3m94","slide":13,"text":"02","textPreview":"02","textChars":2,"textLines":1,"bbox":[95,257,55,30]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/je9cvixc","slide":13,"text":"我的门店是否靠流程运转，而不是靠我临时救火？","textPreview":"我的门店是否靠流程运转，而不是靠我临时救火？","textChars":22,"textLines":1,"bbox":[160,252,930,38]}
