{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/1gvy90je","slide":13,"text":"03","textPreview":"03","textChars":2,"textLines":1,"bbox":[95,329,55,30]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/8z25kb6x","slide":13,"text":"我今天有没有教会一个人，发现一个人，培养一个人？","textPreview":"我今天有没有教会一个人，发现一个人，培养一个人？","textChars":24,"textLines":1,"bbox":[160,324,930,38]}
